{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩多翻為母，於字聲論中摩多字從\n冥鉢囉膩波低語中出。冥是摩多體性，鉢囉膩波低是誦摩多義，鉢囉膩波低正翻為置，故以置為母義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於字聲論中摩多字又從茫摩泥語中出，茫亦是體性，摩泥是誦其義，摩泥正翻為量，故以量為母義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如此間合升斗斛之類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊云維摩詰者，不正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊云生死者，非正翻名，今改為流轉也。已後諸云流轉者，皆是此義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂津液也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十六破散禪本闕，不解"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本闕二淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂風黃痰癊等性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂醫方論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石白如貝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂八難也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石白如貝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂太急也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋云近誦，舊云和上者略而訛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋云正行，舊云\n阿闍梨者亦訛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二種五分故有十也"}
